quelqu'un d'autre, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, questa è musica per
le mie orecchie!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
OK, ecco qui!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}You don't want it even if it's free?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Well, I guess you're not going to
change your mind about that.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡¿Ni gratis te interesa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bueno, supongo que no vas
a cambiar de opinión...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma come? Nemmeno gratis?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beh, non mi sembri intenzionat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
